OL,3,GNEWSAVigil takes place for Nepal flash
OL,4,Aflood disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FA candlelight vigil has taken place in
OL,7,FBerkshire for the victims of the flash
OL,8,Fflood in Nepal.
OL,10,FThe gathering at the Ascot War Memorial
OL,11,Fon Wednesday evening was held by
OL,12,FFriends of Nepal UK.
OL,14,FOrganisers said it was to "remember
OL,15,Fthose who have died, hold in thought
OL,16,Fand prayer those who remain missing and
OL,17,Ftheir families, and stand alongside the
OL,18,Fpeople of Nepal at a time of profound
OL,19,Floss".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
