OL,3,GNEWSAVigil takes place for Nepal flash
OL,4,Aflood disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,300 people died when a
OL,7,Fflash flood swept through Nepalese
OL,8,Fborder villages on 26 August.
